  173:   /// Replaces settings and the local library with [map]. Unless [snapshot]
  174:   /// is false, the current state is saved first (see [_saveSnapshot]) and
  175:   /// the snapshot path is returned. This device's [credentialKeys] are kept
  176:   /// unless [importCredentials] (the user agreed) and [map] has them.
  177:   static Future<String?> importAllJsonSettings(
  178:     Map<String, dynamic> map, {
  179:     bool importCredentials = false,
  180:     bool snapshot = true,
  181:   }) async {
  182:     // login mode is a per-device opt-in: a backup must not switch it (the
  183:     // running account state is not re-applied after an import)
  184:     final loginMode = Pref.loginMode;
  185:     // validate everything first, so a bad backup changes nothing; a missing
  186:     // section leaves that box as it is
