[RESOLVED]
- [A1] A1 — traversal blocked and setting warns about credentials.
  Path segments are validated and canonical containment is enforced in `BiliDocumentsProvider.kt:255-276`; create/rename reject invalid names at `:131-177`, and the setting warns at `extra_settings.dart:76-85`.

[RESOLVED]
- [A2] A2 — proxy no longer disables TLS by itself.
  Proxy setup keeps certificate checks unless `Pref.badCertificateCallback` is set in `init.dart:148-177`; proxy UI now warns at `extra_settings.dart:1159-1166`.

[RESOLVED]
- [A3] A3 — Android/iOS WebView mixed content disabled.
  `MIXED_CONTENT_NEVER_ALLOW` is now used in `webview/view.dart:488-495`.

[RESOLVED]
- [A4] A4 — anonymous requests scrub csrf keys too.
  `_accessKeys` now includes csrf aliases and FormData scrubbing in `account_mgr.dart:275-304`.

[RESOLVED]
- [A5] A5 — SponsorBlock server is validated and host-matched.
  Empty/invalid URLs are rejected in `sponsor_block/view.dart:345-356`; skip logic matches parsed host in `account_mgr.dart:228-235`.

[RESOLVED]
- [A6] A6 — WebView reset and reset-all-data clear account cookies.
  Reset marks `_accountCookie` in `webview/view.dart:404-420`; `Accounts.clear()` clears WebView cookies via `accounts.dart:56-64`.

[RESOLVED]
- [A7] A7 — Linux account cookies are session-scoped and cleared.
  Linux note/reset paths pass session cookies and delete WebKit cookies on close in `webview/view.dart:66-82,174-182,404-420`.

[RESOLVED]
- [A8] A8 — cookie login trims and preserves `=` in values.
  Cookie text parsing trims pieces and rejoins values with `=` in `login/controller.dart:176-190`.

[RESOLVED]
- [A9] A9 — WBI failures retry, date check fixed, fetch anonymous.
  Anonymous fetch and full-date comparison are in `wbi_sign.dart:79-118`; failed fetch clears `_future`.

[RESOLVED]
- [A10] A10 — network toasts no longer show query secrets.
  Toast URL is reduced to scheme/authority/path in `account_mgr.dart:181-192`.

[PARTIAL]
- [A11] A11 — cross-origin redirect strips cookies, but not POST body secrets.
  Headers/query/account are cleared in `retry_interceptor.dart:30-44`, but a redirected POST body can still carry csrf fields.

[RESOLVED]
- [A12] A12 — external note-app URLs no longer get account cookies.
  Account-cookie note flow now requires `widget.url`/`oid` and handlers are note-only in `webview/view.dart:66-82,236-250,493-518`.

[RESOLVED]
- [A13] A13 — note title is URL-encoded.
  Form rewrite uses `Uri.encodeQueryComponent` in `webview/view.dart:619`.

[RESOLVED]
- [A14] A14 — malformed/partial settings import is validated before clearing.
  Import checks map sections and snapshots before replacement in `storage.dart:177-223`.

[RESOLVED]
- [A15] A15 — live danmaku reconnects and short headers are rejected.
  Header length is 16-byte checked in `live.dart:48-56`; disconnect callback/retry is wired in `live_room/controller.dart:413-523`.

[RESOLVED]
- [A16] A16 — saving original images copies cache files.
  Desktop save uses `copy` and no cache cleanup in `image_utils.dart:157-186`.

[RESOLVED]
- [A17] A17 — changing download path clears stale queue and pauses active work.
